Exegetica
Copyright (c) 2026 Hi-Low Studio

Exegetica serves openly licensed and public-domain data through its Study Bible
tools, its History tools, and its Reading Room. Each source keeps its own license.
This file credits every source the way its license asks, and lists the public-domain
sources too, so the record is complete. scripts/corpus_manifest.py --check compares
this file with the databases.

